<p style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:14px;color:#334155;">Hi <%= @owner.first_name.presence || "there" %>,</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:14px;color:#334155;"><%= @business.name %> is scheduled to be permanently deleted on <strong><%= @business.deletion_due_at.to_date.to_fs(:long) %></strong>, as asked. Its clients, quotes, jobs, invoices, payments, files and settings will be removed and can't be recovered.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:14px;color:#334155;">To keep anything, download it from Settings → Your data before then. To cancel, reply to <a href="mailto:<%= @support %>"><%= @support %></a> before that date.</p>
